title: SandboxTalk
---
<<if met("flag:talked_aoi")>>
    Aoi: Back again? The lanterns are still on my mind.
<<else>>
    Aoi: Oh, you're up. Couldn't sleep either?
    <<flag talked_aoi>>
<<endif>>
Aoi: The lanterns? They have always lit them from the gate inward, one each night of the festival. Why do you ask?
-> Just curious.
    Aoi: Curious is good. Most people never look up.
-> Isn't that the old solstice order? #needs:knowledge>=1
    Aoi: You noticed? Three lit, two dark. Always the same three.
    <<flag lantern_hint>>
-> Tell her about the snow. #needs:guts>=1
    Aoi: Snow? In August? You're braver than me for saying it out loud.
    <<bond aoi 1>>
The night air is warm. Somewhere, cicadas.
<<stat guts 1>>
===
